      "source_url": "https://thaqalayn.net/hadith/9/4/4/4",
      "text": [
        " الله عزوجل: كُلُّ شَيْءٍ هَالِكٌ إِلَّا وَجْهَهُ قال: من أتى الله بما امر به من طاعة محمد صلى الله عليه وآله فهو الوجه الذي لا يهلك و كذلك قال: مَّن يُطِعِ الرَّسُولَ فَقَدْ أَطَاعَ اللَّهَ"
      ],
      "translations": {
        "en.ammaar-muslim": [
          "4. [4/332] al-Kafi: A number of our companions from Ahmad b. Muhammad b. Khalid from Ahmad b. Muhammad b. Abi Nasr from Safwan al-Jammal from Abi Abdillah عليه السلام  about the words of Allah Mighty and Majestic: “Everything is to perish except His face” <a href=\"/books/quran:28#h88\">[28:88]</a>. He said: Whoever comes to Allah with what he had been ordered (to do) in terms of obeying Muhammad صلى الله عليه وآله then he is the ‘face’ who will not perish. In a similar vein Did He say: “whoever obeys the Messenger has obeyed Allah” <a href=\"/books/quran:4#h80\">[4:80]</a>."
        ]
      }
    },
